      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This mimics what I've experienced daily driving the Steam Audio Beta; Index users are praising it as the the best thing since Earmuff mode, and Quest find it disorientating and wrong. \n\nI'm not sure about the stance that an acclimation is necessary - it sounds perfect right away on Index.\n\nThere's likely a design difference with Quest headsets that need specific addressing.",
